# M14 "Pazar", flow "shop_homes" run 3 (PostgreSQL test database, 1024x640 @150 %): the Kargan mage
# "Ocakli" of run 1, seeded by vo_admin with 300 Akçe and its bag filled up with Kül Tozu (27 stacks of
# 20 next to the kit's Kırağı Asası), in Demirağız. The town's potion stall and smithy; with a full bag a
# potion cannot be bought ("Çantanda yer yok."); a Kül Tozu stack is sold with the quantity box (default
# the whole stack: "Alınacak: 20 Akçe"), then three Ayaz Özü are bought and one is drunk from the bar
# ("+mp" in blue). The smith's window at the small layout (the HUD pieces it covers yield).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m14_homes
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars2 900
expecttext select.slot1 Demirağız
clickon select.slot1
wait 5
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+zone3+npcs2+npcanimated 1800
scene expectcoins = 300
scene expectitem 9 = 540
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene shoplog
scene walkto 258 334
waitfor world+nodest+standing 900
scene camera 290 16 12
wait 15
screenshot 21_demiragiz_stalls.png

# ---- The potion stall: a full bag, then room for the potions ----
scene talk Kül Anası Tamar
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene expectshop Kül Anası Tamar
clickon shop.item.19
waitfor world+modal+quantitybox 120
key enter
waitfor world+buyrefused1+shopidle 600
scene expectshopmessage Çantanda yer yok.
scene camera at:Kül_Anası_Tamar 16 6
wait 8
screenshot 22_bag_full.png
rclickon inv.bag.27
waitfor world+modal+quantitybox 120
expecttext quantity.value 20
expecttext quantity.total Alınacak: 20 Akçe
key enter
waitfor world+sold1+shopidle 600
scene expectshopmessage 20 × Kül Tozu satıldı (+20 Akçe).
scene expectcoins = 320
clickon shop.item.19
waitfor world+modal+quantitybox 120
key up
key up
expecttext quantity.total Toplam: 75 Akçe
key enter
waitfor world+bought1+shopidle 600
scene expectshopmessage 3 × Ayaz Özü alındı (75 Akçe).
scene expectcoins = 245
dragon inv.bag.27 skillbar.slot.3
waitfor world+barsets1+baridle 300
scene expectbarcount 3 3
wait 5
screenshot 23_demiragiz_potions.png
key escape
wait 3
expect world+shopclosed+invclosed
move 300 200
key 3
waitfor world+potionuses1+potioncd 300
scene expectbarcount 3 2
scene camera behind 20 6
wait 6
screenshot 24_mana_potion.png

# ---- The smith at the small layout ----
scene talk Örsbaşı Gürşad
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene expectshop Örsbaşı Gürşad
expecttext shop.contents Kırağı Asası 60
scene camera at:Örsbaşı_Gürşad 16 6
wait 10
screenshot 25_smith_small_layout.png
scene shoplog
quit
